NAME
    rmdir - Remove an existing empty directory. The root directory cannot be removed.

SYNOPSIS
    rmdir <folder_name>

DOMAIN
    userland

DESCRIPTION
    Remove an existing empty directory. The root directory cannot be removed.

FAT NAME SUPPORT
    The current Inu FAT provider creates and renames entries using FAT 8.3 short names.
    Long-file-name creation and rename are reserved for a later filesystem-provider extension.

EXAMPLES
    rmdir TEST

FILES
    /System/Commands/RMDIR.CMD
    /INU/HELP/RMDIR.MAN
